=begin

  rs.lic

  Short-name launcher for rs_sagapanel.lic (Radial Sweep READY lamp).

  Usage:
    ;rs                      - Start the lamp
    ;rs_sagapanel            - Same, run the panel script directly

  Once running: *rs help / click READY / *rs fire

       creator: loraque (loraque@gmail.com)
        author: loraque (loraque@gmail.com)
          game: Gemstone
          tags: saga, frontend, panel, combat, launcher, radialsweep
      required: Lich >= 5.12.0
       version: 0.1.0

  changelog:
    0.1.0 (2026-10-22)
      initial launcher for rs_sagapanel

=end

if Script.running?('rs_sagapanel')
  echo '[lich] rs: lamp already running - *rs help'
else
  Script.start('rs_sagapanel')
end
